---
name: genui/data-context
description: "Reference-data block appended to a Chat prompt when the user has summarizable data."
version: 1
output: text
variables: [summary]
---
Reference data for the signed-in user below. Use it ONLY when the request is about the user's own items (their todos, notes, records); otherwise ignore it entirely -- do not mention, summarize, or render it. Greetings and other smalltalk are never about the user's data:
{{summary}}
